<title>BELGIUM: Belgolux Jan-Nov trade surplus narrows.</title>
<headline>Belgolux Jan-Nov trade surplus narrows.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Office released the following provisional data on trade in the Belgo-Luxembourg Economic Union (in billions of francs) -</p>
<p>    BELGOLUX TRADE		   Nov 96    Oct 96    Nov 95</p>
<p>    Exports			    434.9     494.2     432.9</p>
<p>    Imports			    382.0     442.4     399.8</p>
<p>    Balance			     53.0	51.8	33.1</p>
<p>					Jan-Nov 96	    Jan-Nov 95</p>
<p>    Exports (cumulative)	 4,791.5		 4,637.8</p>
<p>    Imports (cumulative)	 4,409.6		 4,219.6</p>
<p>    Balance			    381.9		   418.3</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
